  <data name="About.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>PDFlight is a viewer with integrated file operations
(move, copy, delete, rename, mail).
Frequently used target folders are kept in a list, so
files can be moved in a flash without leaving the
program. In addition, pages can be removed from the
PDF or extracted to a new file, and another PDF file
can be appended.</value></data>
